{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "combo-s-nav",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 玩家普攻｜结构图\nPlayerCombo持有原激活内的段序、输入请求和Task／窗口／移动资源。\nASC持有原请求与终止认证；Animation提供Montage／姿态契约；CMC唯一执行胶囊位移；Combat查询并去重命中。\n[[计划_玩家普攻连段|连段说明]] · [[AbilitySystem/结构|GAS结构]] · [[GGYGO_流程_玩家普攻连段.canvas|连段流程]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 1510,
      "height": 190,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "combo-s-input",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 输入请求边界\nIA_Attack：Pressed配置为上次资产检查点。\nASC 活跃Spec InputPressed → WaitComboInput。\n任务给 SourceStep/RequestId；Combo保存唯一有截止时间Pending。\n激活重试归ASC/Hero；它不替代GA内换段。\n[[Input/结构|输入职责]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 280,
      "width": 450,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "combo-s-ga",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## UGGYGOPlayerComboAbility\nInitialize/Body接收已签Original；段/token/窗口/唯一Pending与FStepMotionResources归Combo。\nReady原Snapshot→Main请求CMC；SectionReceived→End退Main、观察原QualifiedMovementIntent。\n合格原Scope/Intent复核→退原Action→End(true,true)；自然完成Authority/false，普通Cancel保持。\nRequired历史OnFailed核自身Original/段/强Task/资源→正式End，CanBeCanceled=false也适用。\nContext Cleanup先脱原成员再退资源；终止证明/Busy/Completed仍归基类。\n[[AbilitySystem/计划_原请求终止|原终止]]",
      "x": 530,
      "y": 280,
      "width": 450,
      "height": 390,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "combo-s-config",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## FGGYGOComboStep[] / 正式GA\nMontage、Main/End、MotionSlotName、MotionTranslationScale、Next、Rate、Damage/Poise、TraceShape/Socket配置。\nValidateComboConfiguration校验必需来源，Slot必须显式，倍率有限>0；缺曲线不换速度。\nGA_Pyrios_Attack_Combo父类/三段字段已冷读回，探索整体failed仍留账。\n已选GE无效不换Shared/无GE；详细有效模式与待验资产见父文档。",
      "x": 1060,
      "y": 280,
      "width": 450,
      "height": 340,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "combo-s-task",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Montage Task / WaitComboInput\nCombo保存各原Task/native token；输入Task只消费真实GAS新按下。\nMontage Task持原Playback/Guard/scale；Snapshot/SectionReceived取自真实原实例，无dt游标。\n播放前Acquire；Required-only原引擎Tick Poll。失败先Stop/EndTask清资源，再历史OnFailed。\nStartup NONE、Playback原ID；弱Get(true)只识历史发送者，GA另证原资源，不求已结束Task仍Active。\nnative结束原GA则不发旧BP；普通Cancelled/Completed保持。\n[[AbilitySystem/结构|Task契约]]",
      "x": 530,
      "y": 750,
      "width": 450,
      "height": 390,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "combo-s-anim",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Animation Source / Required Pose / CMC\nAnimation BuildSourceBinding冻结原Main PosXYZ；CMC BeginMontageActionMotion经native RMS/碰撞唯一执行胶囊位移。\nABP_Pyrios Required FullBody ActionPoseSlot已保存，IgnoreRootMotion；不固定Replace身体Z。\nGuard声明/节点求值与epoch归Animation，Task只持原Ticket/只读Poll。\n[[Animation/动作姿态修正|姿态执行]] · [[Movement/结构|胶囊/移动事实]]",
      "x": 1060,
      "y": 750,
      "width": 450,
      "height": 330,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "combo-s-hit",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Hero MeleeTrace / Builder / GE / Cue\nHeroCharacter持MeleeTraceComponent。\n服务器TryOpenOwnedTraceWindow→签发原窗口；SubscribeWindowHit→原Window/Actor/HitResult。\nCombat唯一做采样/去重/Tick；不决策伤害/GA终止。\nCombo校验Original/段/Task/Window，再BuildHitEffectPayload→Spec与Cue数据。\n合法GE经ASC Apply→GE/Execution/AttributeSet；显式无GE只走合法Cue。\nUnsubscribeWindowHit/CloseOwnedTraceWindow精确退原资源。\n[[Combat/结构|查询契约]] · [[GGYGO_流程_伤害结算.canvas|伤害链]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 750,
      "width": 450,
      "height": 390,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "combo-s-network",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 强类型纠正与完成边界\nWaitComboInput：SourceStep + RequestId。\nClientCorrectAbilityState(Spec,key,TargetData)只筛来源并转发。\nFGGYGOComboCorrectionData归Combo：段/位置/窗口/Revision；ReceiveAbilityCorrection核对单项确切类型与范围。\nRequestAbilityEnd/Cancel消费固定Original；结果历史不是新调用权限。\nGA数据、ASC本地通知、Completed三种事件各有自己的字段/时点契约。\n下一激活由原请求/回调返回后的受控调用方继续。\nraw来源无外层受控Try见证可清资源，但不发布协议Completed。",
      "x": 530,
      "y": 1230,
      "width": 650,
      "height": 390,
      "color": "5"
    }
  ],
  "edges": [
    {
